#: kio_floppy.cpp:209
msgid ""
"drive %1.\n"
"The drive is still busy.\n"
"Wait until it has stopped working and then try again."
msgstr ""
"ໄດຣຟ໌ %1\n"
"ໄດຣຟ໌ນີ້ຍັງມີການທຳງານຄ້າງຢູ່\n"
"ກະລຸນາຖ້າຈົນກວ່າມັນຈະຢຸດທຳງານຫລັງຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ລອງອີກຄັ້ງ"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:213 kio_floppy.cpp:1124
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably full."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ແຜ່ນດີສ໌ກໍ່ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ %1 "
"ເບິ່ງຄືຈະເຕັມ"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:223
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %1"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ເບິ່ງຄຶວ່າ "
"ຈະເບິ່ງມີແຜ່ນດິສ໌ຢຸ່ໃນໄດຣຟ໌%1"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:227
msgid ""
"\n"
"The drive %1 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ບໍ່ສະຫນັບສະຫນຸນໄດຣຟ໌%1"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:232
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure the floppy in drive %1 is a DOS formatted floppy disk \n"
"and that the permissions of the device file (e.g. /dev/fd0) are set "
"correctly (e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ "
"ແຜ່ນຟລັອປປີ້ດິສ໌ໃນໄດຣຟ໌์ %1 \n"
"ເປັນແຜ່ນທີ່ເປັນແບບ DOS "
"ແລະສິດໃນການໃຊ້ງານອຸປະກອນ"
"\n"
"(ເຊັ່ນ/dev/fd0) "
"ຖຶກຕັ້ງຢ່າງຖຶກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ"
"(ເຊັ່ນ rwxrwxrwx)"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:236
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably not a DOS formatted floppy disk."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ແຜ່ນຟລັອປປີ້້ດິສໃນໄດຣຟ໌%1 "
"ເບິ່ງຄືຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນແຜ່ນແບບ DOS"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:240
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably write-protected."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ແຜ່ນຟລັອປປີ້ດິສ໌ໃນໄດຣຟ໌%1 "
"ເບິ່ງຄຶຈະມີການປ້ອງກັນຂງນໄວ້"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:284 kio_floppy.cpp:511 kio_floppy.cpp:602 kio_floppy.cpp:735
#: kio_floppy.cpp:812 kio_floppy.cpp:898 kio_floppy.cpp:978
#: kio_floppy.cpp:1078
msgid ""
"\n"
"Ensure that the mtools package is installed correctly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ກະລຸນາແນ່ໃຈວ່າ "
"ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພກເກຈ໌ mtools "
"ເທິງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:558 kio_floppy.cpp:573 kio_floppy.cpp:577 kio_floppy.cpp:647
msgid "Reason unknown."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ເຫດຜົນ"

#~ msgid "Don't know why, sorry."
#~ msgstr "ขออภัย ไม่ทราบเหมือนกันว่าทำไม"

